    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical team-building auto-battler with active and passive playstyles. Draft a team as you explore maps full of monsters, build synergies, equip items and cast spells to support your team during battles and help them escape the Underboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Auto Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/eedd162c0b2023d6ea74b8d0ca7c5bd7.poster.avif?t=1750219951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/eedd162c0b2023d6ea74b8d0ca7c5bd7.webm?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/eedd162c0b2023d6ea74b8d0ca7c5bd7.mp4?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters battle on their own based on positioning and aggression. Look out for enemy threats and position your team accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells to actively support your team in battles or provide them with passive bonuses. Upgrade your best spells or go for more tactical flexibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/f0af301773ed14991ec62762545d4c47.poster.avif?t=1750219951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/f0af301773ed14991ec62762545d4c47.webm?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/f0af301773ed14991ec62762545d4c47.mp4?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft a team of characters with random trait bonuses. Get more characters with the same traits to upgrade them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your characters by killing monsters and gaining experience, then unlock their evolutions by killing bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and craft items with stat bonuses, extra traits or unique effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build synergies by equiping items to your characters and casting your spells to support them, there are thousands of possibilities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map Explorations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/fae63d07ffec3e6dcc9c84e4fd570910.poster.avif?t=1750219951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/fae63d07ffec3e6dcc9c84e4fd570910.webm?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/fae63d07ffec3e6dcc9c84e4fd570910.mp4?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomized maps with fog of war and full of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find as many rewards as you can before the map boss finds you, then kill them to reach higher maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge pinnacle bosses at the end of your explorations and kill them to unlock harder zones to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock masteries as you explore, allowing you to specialize your teams for future explorations!</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tactical team-building auto-battler with active and passive playstyles. Draft a team as you explore maps full of monsters, build synergies, equip items and cast spells to support your team during battles and help them escape the Underboard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Tactical Auto Battler</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/eedd162c0b2023d6ea74b8d0ca7c5bd7.poster.avif?t=1750219951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/eedd162c0b2023d6ea74b8d0ca7c5bd7.webm?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/eedd162c0b2023d6ea74b8d0ca7c5bd7.mp4?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Characters battle on their own based on positioning and aggression. Look out for enemy threats and position your team accordingly.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cast spells to actively support your team in battles or provide them with passive bonuses. Upgrade your best spells or go for more tactical flexibility.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Team Building</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/f0af301773ed14991ec62762545d4c47.poster.avif?t=1750219951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/f0af301773ed14991ec62762545d4c47.webm?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/f0af301773ed14991ec62762545d4c47.mp4?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Draft a team of characters with random trait bonuses. Get more characters with the same traits to upgrade them.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Level up your characters by killing monsters and gaining experience, then unlock their evolutions by killing bosses.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find and craft items with stat bonuses, extra traits or unique effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build synergies by equiping items to your characters and casting your spells to support them, there are thousands of possibilities!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Map Explorations</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/fae63d07ffec3e6dcc9c84e4fd570910.poster.avif?t=1750219951\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/fae63d07ffec3e6dcc9c84e4fd570910.webm?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2376610/extras/fae63d07ffec3e6dcc9c84e4fd570910.mp4?t=1750219951\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore randomized maps with fog of war and full of monsters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find as many rewards as you can before the map boss finds you, then kill them to reach higher maps.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge pinnacle bosses at the end of your explorations and kill them to unlock harder zones to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock masteries as you explore, allowing you to specialize your teams for future explorations!</p></li></ul>",
